  "title": "Grilled Lemon and Rosemary Lamb Chops",
  "description": "Try this recipe for grilled lamb chops and serve up a mouthwatering main for your family. A yogurt-based marinade of lemon juice, cinnamon, rosemary, and oregano adds fantastic flavor.",
  "authors": [
    "John Mitzewich"
  ],
